  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Donation to to the Norwegian Broadcasting Corporation&apos; s (NRK) Telethon in 2021 - &quot;Barn ikke Brud&quot; (&quot;Children not Brides&quot;), to prevent early marriage. Will be implemented in five countries; Bangladesh, Nepal, Malawi, Mali and Niger.</narrative>
